{aligned}T(v) & =T\\cdot v \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 3 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-6 \\\\ 20 \\\\ 15 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
